  "details": "Want to download a 3D map of the city, and then let's say I install vrchat on my mobile, chose an avatar and walk with the phone with gps on my city in the real world and via the phone camera(as in pokemongo) see other users who went to this map via the Internet. My avatar, who moves with reference to gps, should be different from others who just went to such a server. I can communicate with them through the microphone and speaker or mobile headphones, and see through the camera. I want to make 3d mapping of the whole city with my phone so that other users can see what I see. Imagine how fun it will be, I go around the city with my phone in my pocket, with a hided game and headphones in my ears, when I suddenly hear voices from vrchat) I get the phone I go into the game and there through the camera I see that around me a lot of users and begin to communicate with them) you can Monetize by selling billboards in VIAR in places of congestion of users at auctions.",
